00:18:51,780 --> 00:18:53,309
Everything all right, pal?

255
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:54,660
No, Joey.

256
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,940
It's far from all right.

257
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:01,440
I didn't outsmart him.

258
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,660
He succeeded.

259
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:05,740
Yugi's gone.

260
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:23,380
Great Leviathan, please
accept my latest offering.

261
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:34,360
I don't get it.

262
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:37,741
How can you be talking to
us if he took your soul?

263
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,437
Not mine. Yugi's.

264
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:43,997
It's all my fault.

265
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,700
Yugi, come back.

266
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:51,477
It should have been me, not him.

267
00:19:51,560 --> 00:19:53,180
It's not fair.

268
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:03,110
Yo!
